title: GENIE BPC CRC FOLFOX transportability study
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis code and executed notebooks for a survival-modeling
  study of adults with metastatic colorectal cancer treated with first-line
  FOLFOX-based therapy, including internal-external validation across
  institutions.
